<title>USA: Tele-Communications posts tender offer.</title>
<headline>Tele-Communications posts tender offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele-Communications Inc on Tuesday posted a tender offer to buy up to 10 million shares of its Liberty Media Group common stock for $27.00 per share.</p>
<p>The offer, which ran in the Wall Street Journal, applies to Liberty series A and series B common stock and will expire at 1700 EDT on September 17, the advertisement said.</p>
<p>Liberty Media is a unit of Tele-Communications, a cable TV operator.</p>
</text>
